9,"out":90}},{"attempts":[{"latency_ms":2706,"ok":true,"retries":0,"stateless":false}],"context":[],"failed":[],"fallback":[],"items":[19,20,21],"latency_ms":2706,"layout":{"calibration":0.8450504189745767,"history_chars":0,"history_tok":0,"lcp_tok":49.283340434597434,"memory_tok":0,"stable_chars":213,"stable_tok":45.18484590257073,"volatile_chars":102,"volatile_tok":73.81515409742927},"n":7,"reply":"{\"translations\": [\"다시 다음 달에 말씀드리면 안 되겠습니다. 저부터 먼저 村田さんに 전화해 보죠.\", \"부탁드립니다. 十河課長님만이 의지할 수 있습니다.\", \"전화해 보겠습니다. 村田상이 받으시면, 稟議의 기한도 함께 알려드리겠습니다.\"]}\n","screen":6,"terms_added":[],"usage":{"cached":0,"in":119,"out":72}},{"attempts":[{"latency_ms":2114,"ok":true,"retries":0,"stateless":false}],"context":[],"failed":[],"fallback":[],"items":[22,23,24],"latency_ms":2114,"layout":{"calibration":0.8681084374048118,"history_chars":0,"history_tok":0,"lcp_tok":50.628084069448754,"memory_tok":0,"stable_chars":213,"stable_tok":46.417758148035404,"volatile_chars":93,"volatile_tok":67.5822418519646},"n":8,"reply":"{\"translations\": [\"저는, 견적서가 도착하면 바로 호タル 분의 승인서를 작성하겠습니다.\", \"네. 그런데, 고객용 주차장은 처리하셨나요?\", \"아직입니다. 대수가 결정되면 바로 주문하겠습니다.\"]}\n","screen":7,"terms_added":[],"usage":{"cached":0,"in":114,"out":54}},{"attempts":[{"latency_ms":2267,"ok":true,"retries":0,"stateless":false}],"context":[],"failed":[],"fallback":[],"items":[25,26,27],"latency_ms":2267,"layout":{"calibration":0.8325832583258317,"history_chars":0,"history_tok":0,"lcp_tok":48.55625562556263,"memory_tok":0,"stable_chars":213,"stable_tok":44.51822682268233,"volatile_chars":95,"volatile_tok":66.48177317731765},"n":9,"reply":"{\"translations\": [\"아, 아미구미상은 전철로 오신다고 해요. 주차장은 필요 없습니다.\", \"알겠습니다. 그럼, 입구에서 기다리겠습니다.\", \"열시에 아미구미상이 오시면, 저에게 바로 알려주세요.\"]}\n","screen":8,"terms_added":[],"usage":{"cached":0,"in":111,"out":59}},{"attempts":[{"latency_ms":2701,"ok":true,"retries":0,"stateless":false}],"context":[],"failed":[],"fallback":[],"items":[28,29,30],"latency_ms":2701,"layout":{"calibration":0.8417051316861247,"his